          "doi": "10.1007/BF00213831",
          "url": "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00213831",
          "design_decision": "Supports external-zone neuronal terminals adjacent to the primary portal capillary plexus and distinction from deeper neural tissue; no peptide identity or pituitary target is depicted."
        },
        {
          "id": "ovarian_follicle_topology",
          "citation": "Abdelnaby EA, Yasin NA, Abouelela YS, Rashad E, Daghash SM, El-Sherbiny HR. Ovarian, uterine, and luteal vascular perfusions during follicular and luteal phases in the adult cyclic female rabbits with special orientation to their histological detection of hormone receptor. BMC Vet Res. 2022;18:301.",
